# Skyclave Apparition with "Illusion" changed to "Elf" by Artificial Evolution (CR 612.4, 612.2a): the token its
# leaves-the-battlefield ability makes is what that ability's text says, so Mind Stone's owner creates a 2/2 blue Elf token,
# named for its subtypes (CR 111.4), not an Illusion. Skyclave exiles Mind Stone (mana value 2) on turn 3, the text change
# follows, and Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 4.

